2026-11-14T20:03:34Z	I want `coga status` to make stalled work visible. Tickets regularly sit in_progress for days after an agent session dies or I forget an owner gate, and I only notice by accident. A ticket counts as stalled when its most recent coga/log.md entry is older than a threshold; the threshold should be configurable in coga.toml with a sensible default. `coga status` should mark stalled tickets and offer a way to list only them. No notifications or automatic actions; that is a separate idea. It is a code change; use code/with-review.
